nd the completion state has a visible white border. This benchmark records the flow as excluded from execution due to the explicit no-browser instruction.'\n\\\"\"'$up\" --step-paragraph \"$plan\" 01-button-chain-plan/05-step-ui-verification 7.1 '\"'The future executor records browser evidence in US-01 and its run cache; this planning proof records the constraint and does not claim a browser pass.'\n\"","aggregated_output":"Updated section\nUpdated section\nUpdated field\nField was not found exactly once: UI validation required\n","exit_code":64,"status":"failed"}}
